# Data license and attribution

The data in this folder (data/raw, data/cleaned, data/processed) is derived from
the FiNER-139 dataset. It is NOT covered by the repository's MIT code license.

## Source

FiNER-139 — Financial Numeric Entity Recognition for XBRL Tagging
- Authors: Lefteris Loukas, Manos Fergadiotis, Ilias Chalkidis, Eirini Spyropoulou,
  Prodromos Malakasiotis, Ion Androutsopoulos, Georgios Paliouras (ACL 2022)
- Dataset: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nlpaueb/finer-139
- Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.06482
- Underlying filings: US SEC EDGAR (public domain)

## License

FiNER-139 is released under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0
International License (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Because this dataset is CC BY-SA 4.0, our redistribution keeps the same license:
anyone using data/ must give attribution to the original authors and share any
derivatives under CC BY-SA 4.0 as well.

## What we changed

- data/raw/: the original FiNER-139 data, unchanged.
- data/cleaned/: deduplicated, train/validation-test leakage removed, and a share
  of no-entity (O-only) train sentences dropped.
- data/processed/: the cleaned data tokenized (bert-base-cased) and label-aligned.

